le explicit assumptions: real successful text200, no fabricated backend success; decodable positive corpus with signature-only validation. No answer required to finish this design.\",\n    \"For production capacity acceptance supply measured/contractual p99 SLA, peak workload and upstream quotas; missing facts remain blocking release evidence, not invented numbers.\"\n  ],\n  \"tooling_deviations\": [\n    \"Requested skill and validator locations omit universal/; actual files found via skill INDEX and read from canonical universal paths.\",\n    \"Actual role validator uses positional PLAN --phase before|after; before-fingerprint argument unsupported. Supplied plans/architect-01.before.json is worktree schema2.0, not a role plan; retained immutable; separate initial role plan provided.\",\n    \"Actual arch validator needs --packet,--run-dir,--role-plan,--repo-root,--fingerprint-before,--fingerprint-after,--task,--receipt; prints PASS: ARCH_GATE rather than ARCH_GATE_VALID. No wrapper/verifier-output spoof created.\",\n    \"Supplied fingerprint includes .ai-team/runs artifacts and concurrent log writes. Original retained; derive product projection by excluding ONLY .ai-team/runs/** from ORIGINAL manifest, recomputing digest, comparing current identically scoped snapshot. No fresh/rebased baseline.\",\n    \"Existing health.images bool and _cid_release(cid,turn_id) override inaccurate proposed shapes/signature; all external behavior design remains as requested.\",\n    \"Actual test baseline is6008lines; entire blob is immutable, not guessed6009 line count.\"\n  ],\n  \"role_plan\": {\n    \"path\": \"plans/architect-01.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"4be065fb9f0cf884fbb8ee3f5c2810403d1f0b02cfa9e5d5e2791786741f1176\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.1\",\n  \"role\": \"coder\",\n  \"task_id\": \"agy-universal-image-fallback\",\n  \"run_id\": \"agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029\",\n  \"iteration\": 1,\n  \"role_plan\": {\n    \"path\": \".ai-team/runs/agy-univer